    "q-82680": {
      "dom_id": "step-q82680",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "What is the root of the function $f(x)=1-4x?$",
      "worked_solution": "The roots are the solutions to the equation $f(x)=0,$ which we solve as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =0 \\\\ 1-4x & =0 \\\\ 4x & =1 \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root $x=\\frac{1}{4}.$",
